flowchart TD
    Start([Document mutation]) --> Validate{Valid request?}
    Validate -- No --> Reject[Return validation error]
    Validate -- Yes --> Persist[Persist source document]
    Persist --> Update[Update in-process postings]
    Update --> Stage[Write generation staging file]
    Stage --> Publish[Rename generation and manifest]
    Publish --> Complete[Return searchVisible true]
    Stage --> Failure{Filesystem failure?}
    Failure -- Yes --> Durable[Source document remains durable]
    Durable --> Recovery[Startup rebuild from SQLite]
    Failure -- No --> Publish

    Async[Phase 2 durable job] -. future bounded worker .-> Start
